# Chapter IV, Stormwend: the Thieves Guild's jobs at the port. A whispered
# message for the Korynthian captain, then the Masterthief's stolen letter,
# taken back from the Kanzler's mercenaries with a drugged bottle of wine.
# Position stands in for the walks; ref FormIDs carry Arktwend's slot 05.
# Run: python -m tools.live.test_instance mwtest --cases <this folder> --fast --checkpoints --stop-on-fail --from port_korynth
# See docs/commentary/headless_testing.md#quest-runs

# Captain Korynth hears the code words, and the player asks about the stones.
case port_korynth
run
player->Position 1150 58950 213 0
talk DIEBKapitanKorynth
ask what can I
choose 1
choose 3
bye
expect GetJournalIndex A_IV_Diebesgilde == 13
expect GetJournalIndex A_IV_SchwarzeSteine == 1
end

# Black Eye Piet pays 300 gold, and will say nothing about the stones.
case port_piet
run
player->PositionCell -144 2481 325 0 "Stormwend, Thieves Guild"
talk DIEBSchwarzaugenPiet
ask What did you find out?
choose 1
choose 2
bye
expect GetJournalIndex A_IV_Diebesgilde == 14
expect GetJournalIndex A_IV_SchwarzeSteine == 2
end

# Jarko the Juggler: the mercenaries at the port killed a courier.
case port_jarko
run
player->PositionCell -880 2456 323 0 "Stormwend, Thieves Guild"
talk DIEBJarkoderGaukler
ask What's the mark?
bye
expect GetJournalIndex A_IV_Diebesgilde == 15
end

# One of the mercenaries sends the player to their captain.
case port_mercenary
run
player->Position -57 51300 226 0
until 300 "DIEBSoldner01"->GetDisabled == 0
talk DIEBSoldner01
bye
expect GetJournalIndex A_IV_Diebesgilde == 16
end

# The captain wants wine rather than a fight.
case port_captain
run
player->Position -180 51350 235 0
talk DIEBSoldnerHautmann
ask Message of the Masterthief
choose 2
bye
expect GetJournalIndex A_IV_Diebesgilde == 18
end

# Bernward sells a sleeping draught for 12 gold.
case port_draught
run
player->Position 738 51730 215 0
until 300 "Bernward"->GetDisabled == 0
talk Bernward
ask insect miticide
choose 1
bye
expect GetJournalIndex A_IV_Diebesgilde == 19
expect player->GetItemCount Betaubungsmittel == 1
end

# The mercenaries drink it and fall asleep for good.
case port_wine
run
player->Position -180 51350 235 0
until 300 "DIEBSoldnerHautmann"->GetDisabled == 0
talk DIEBSoldnerHautmann
ask wine
choose 1
choose 2
bye
until 300 "DIEBSoldnerHautmann"->GetHealth <= 0
expect GetJournalIndex A_IV_Diebesgilde == 20
end

# Take All from the captain's body: the letter, its seal already broken.
case port_letter
console 05B95279.removeallitems player
until 300 GetJournalIndex A_IV_Diebesgilde == 21
expect player->GetItemCount MeisterdiebinBrief == 1
end

# Jarko takes the letter and believes the player did not read it.
case port_jarko_letter
run
player->PositionCell -880 2456 323 0 "Stormwend, Thieves Guild"
talk DIEBJarkoderGaukler
ask Message of the Masterthief
choose 1
bye
expect GetJournalIndex A_IV_Diebesgilde == 22
expect player->GetItemCount MeisterdiebinBrief == 0
end

# The Masterthief pays 800 gold and raises the player's rank.
case port_masterthief
run
player->PositionCell -803 1914 323 0 "Stormwend, Thieves Guild"
talk DIEBMeisterdieb
bye
expect GetJournalIndex A_IV_Diebesgilde == 23
expect GetPCRank Diebesgilde >= 1
end

# Jarko has heard of the promotion.
case port_jarko_promoted
run
player->PositionCell -880 2456 323 0 "Stormwend, Thieves Guild"
talk DIEBJarkoderGaukler
bye
expect GetJournalIndex A_IV_Diebesgilde == 24
end
